    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to Ridiculous Gungame!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight your friends in this fast-paced instagib shooter featuring absolutely ridiculous guns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1224310/extras/932c3c0b0a632195100ac5bac1214784.poster.avif?t=1749481272\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1224310/extras/932c3c0b0a632195100ac5bac1214784.webm?t=1749481272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1224310/extras/932c3c0b0a632195100ac5bac1214784.mp4?t=1749481272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Maps!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will have access to 4 maps with more on the way!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nebula's Edge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Four Seasons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pirates Paradise</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Winston's Churchhill</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1224310/extras/c94c56dffdd9d2ee4329b1f6a2105145.avif?t=1749481272\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Guns!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And 30+ ridiculous guns to kill your friends with! What's that? You're wondering why there is a Trombone, or a flower? Guess you'll just have to play the game to find out what they do!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1224310/extras/b582db1377c2169e4ca65a3875b0119c.avif?t=1749481272\" data-has-big /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to Ridiculous Gungame!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight your friends in this fast-paced instagib shooter featuring absolutely ridiculous guns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1224310/extras/932c3c0b0a632195100ac5bac1214784.poster.avif?t=1749481272\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1224310/extras/932c3c0b0a632195100ac5bac1214784.webm?t=1749481272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1224310/extras/932c3c0b0a632195100ac5bac1214784.mp4?t=1749481272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Maps!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will have access to 4 maps with more on the way!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nebula's Edge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Four Seasons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pirates Paradise</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Winston's Churchhill</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1224310/extras/c94c56dffdd9d2ee4329b1f6a2105145.avif?t=1749481272\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Guns!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And 30+ ridiculous guns to kill your friends with! What's that? You're wondering why there is a Trombone, or a flower? Guess you'll just have to play the game to find out what they do!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1224310/extras/b582db1377c2169e4ca65a3875b0119c.avif?t=1749481272\" data-has-big /></div></p>",
